sequenceDiagram
    participant vLLM as vLLM Pod<br/>ZMQ PUB 5557/TCP
    participant ZMQ as ZMQ PUB Socket<br/>5557/TCP
    participant Pool as kvevents.Pool<br/>ZMQ SUB (sharded)
    participant Adapter as Engine Adapter<br/>(vLLM/SGLang)
    participant Index as kvblock.Index<br/>(CostAware/Redis/Valkey/LRU)
    participant Indexer as kvcache.Indexer<br/>Score()
    participant Tokenizer as UDS Tokenizer<br/>gRPC over UDS
    participant Router as llm-d-router<br/>(Scheduler)
    participant GPU as vLLM GPU<br/>CUDA
    participant Worker as llmd-fs-backend<br/>Worker
    participant PVC as Shared PVC<br/>POSIX filesystem
    participant Evictor as PVC Evictor<br/>N+2 processes

    Note over vLLM,Index: Flow 1: KV-Cache Event Ingestion (Write Path)
    vLLM->>ZMQ: KVEvent (3-frame msg)<br/>topic + seqnum + msgpack
    ZMQ->>Pool: ZMQ SUB 5557/TCP<br/>No encryption, No auth
    Pool->>Adapter: FNV-1a sharded dispatch<br/>msgpack decode
    Adapter->>Index: BlockStored / BlockRemoved /<br/>AllBlocksCleared

    Note over Router,Indexer: Flow 2: Pod Scoring (Read Path)
    Router->>Indexer: Score() Go method call<br/>in-process
    Indexer->>Tokenizer: TokenizeRequest<br/>gRPC over UDS<br/>No encryption
    Tokenizer-->>Indexer: Token IDs<br/>gRPC response
    Indexer->>Index: Longest-prefix-match lookup
    Index-->>Indexer: Block locality scores<br/>(GPU/CPU/disk tier)
    Indexer-->>Router: Pod scores<br/>(sorted by cache hit ratio)

    Note over GPU,PVC: Flow 3: KV-Cache Offloading (Storage Path)
    GPU->>Worker: KV-cache blocks<br/>CUDA/torch in-process
    Worker->>PVC: Write blocks<br/>POSIX I/O
    Worker->>ZMQ: Storage event<br/>ZMQ PUB (optional)

    Note over Evictor,PVC: Flow 4: PVC Space Management
    Evictor->>PVC: Monitor disk usage<br/>(N crawlers)
    Note right of Evictor: Trigger at 85%<br/>Stop at 70%
    Evictor->>PVC: Delete stale blocks<br/>(batch of 100)
